                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/releases/tag/11.3.7"&gt;11.3.7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Clipboard rework by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3271797390" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19347" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19347/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19347"&gt;#19347&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Add &lt;code&gt;IsEditable&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;ComboBox&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/almightyju/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/almightyju"&gt;@almightyju&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2824449422" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18094" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18094/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18094"&gt;#18094&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Add &lt;code&gt;SplitViewPanePlacement&lt;/code&gt; settings for &lt;code&gt;Top&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;Bottom&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/danwalmsley/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/danwalmsley"&gt;@danwalmsley&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3321859282" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19465" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19465/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19465"&gt;#19465&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Add &lt;code&gt;HeadingLevel&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;AutomationProperties&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/codecat/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/codecat"&gt;@codecat&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3449705636" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19696" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19696/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19696"&gt;#19696&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;X11 – Add INCR support by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kekekeks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kekekeks"&gt;@kekekeks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2914852260" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18428" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18428/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18428"&gt;#18428&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS – Implement &lt;code&gt;IOSurface/MTLSharedEvent&lt;/code&gt; interop APIs by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kekekeks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kekekeks"&gt;@kekekeks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3039122158" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18791" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18791/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18791"&gt;#18791&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows – Respond to &lt;code&gt;WM_CAPTURECHANGED&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/miloush/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/miloush"&gt;@miloush&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3440829512" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19685" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19685/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19685"&gt;#19685&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Enhancements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Add &lt;code&gt;BoxShadow(s)&lt;/code&gt; documentation comments by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/robloo/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/robloo"&gt;@robloo&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3415548580" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19644" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19644/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19644"&gt;#19644&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Add &lt;code&gt;Add/Remove&lt;/code&gt; event handler methods to &lt;code&gt;DragDrop&lt;/code&gt;. by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/grokys/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/grokys"&gt;@grokys&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3468933954" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19739" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19739/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19739"&gt;#19739&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Themes – Add resource for &lt;code&gt;TextControlPlaceholderOpacity&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/codecat/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/codecat"&gt;@codecat&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3453634095" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19705" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19705/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19705"&gt;#19705&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build – Update &lt;code&gt;Avalonia.BuildServices&lt;/code&gt; package version by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/maxkatz6/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/maxkatz6"&gt;@maxkatz6&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3480085525" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19757" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19757/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19757"&gt;#19757&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix &lt;code&gt;BoxShadow&lt;/code&gt; equality by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3418171585" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19650" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19650/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19650"&gt;#19650&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix typeface exception when created with empty font family name by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jay-mao-cn/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jay-mao-cn"&gt;@jay-mao-cn&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3420166367" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19654" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19654/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19654"&gt;#19654&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Do not recapture already captured element by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/miloush/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/miloush"&gt;@miloush&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3469367721" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19740" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19740/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19740"&gt;#19740&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Fix tooltip hit test following a dirty rect invalidation not respecting &lt;code&gt;IsHitTestVisible&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TomEdwardsEnscape/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TomEdwardsEnscape"&gt;@TomEdwardsEnscape&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3414865646" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19642" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19642/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19642"&gt;#19642&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Limit &lt;code&gt;InlineUIContainer&lt;/code&gt; to available width by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/miloush/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/miloush"&gt;@miloush&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3418196464" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19651" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19651/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19651"&gt;#19651&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
