&lt;li&gt;Controls – Fix focus issues with &lt;code&gt;ComboBox&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/almightyju/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/almightyju"&gt;@almightyju&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3430753359" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19672" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19672/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19672"&gt;#19672&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;XAML – Fix &lt;code&gt;TypeConverterAttribute&lt;/code&gt; for avalonia properties by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kekekeks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kekekeks"&gt;@kekekeks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3462492060" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19727" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19727/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19727"&gt;#19727&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
