&lt;li&gt;X11 – Fix memory leaks when closing a window on Linux by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/dif-sam/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/dif-sam"&gt;@dif-sam&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3450379336" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19699" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19699/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19699"&gt;#19699&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS – Move Drag and Drop logic to &lt;code&gt;TopLevelImpl&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/drasticactions/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/drasticactions"&gt;@drasticactions&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3464465904" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19731" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19731/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19731"&gt;#19731&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Browser – Fix &lt;code&gt;StorageItem&lt;/code&gt; methods not working and handle conversion issue by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Bugord/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Bugord"&gt;@Bugord&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3453955491" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19708" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19708/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19708"&gt;#19708&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build – Remove &lt;code&gt;Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub&lt;/code&gt; PackageReference by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/KirillOsenkov/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/KirillOsenkov"&gt;@KirillOsenkov&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3471184401" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19744" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19744/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19744"&gt;#19744&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
